<view class="setup-page"><view class="setup-kicker">ONE LAST STEP</view><view class="wordmark">Bite<text>Smart</text></view><text class="title">完善你的账号，<br/>让每次登录都更简单。</text><text class="subtitle">微信账号已连接。补充以下信息后，即可同步使用账号密码登录。</text><view class="field"><text>用户名</text><input placeholder="设置一个好记的名字" data-field="username" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>手机号</text><input type="number" placeholder="用于订单联系" data-field="phone" bindinput="onInput"/></view><view class="field"><text>密码</text><input password placeholder="至少 6 位字符" data-field="password" bindinput="onInput"/></view><button class="submit-button" bindtap="submit" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">保存并进入 <text>→</text></button><text wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="error-message">{{errorMessage}}</text></view>
